# shell: desktop
# PVN-058: turning the storage settings off takes the Disks WINDOW with the
# icon -- a window showing what the user asked not to see does not stay.
wait 10
expect-windows 1
note double-clicking the Disks icon opens the root window
click 50 30
wait 2
click 50 30
wait 6
expect-windows 2
note both storage settings off: the icon goes, and the window goes with it
write /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings ShowDisksIcon off
wait 12
expect-windows 1
quit
